  "description": "Compliance implementations for the Excalibur framework. Provides AES-256-GCM encryption, key management, key rotation, and FIPS 140-2 validation for SOC2/GDPR requirements. SOC 2 reports export to JSON, CSV, XML, Excel and text; PDF export is opt-in via the separate Excalibur.Compliance.Pdf package. PRE-RELEASE: the public API is not frozen and may change between pre-release builds. Not recommended for production use. Known issues: https://docs.excalibur-dispatch.dev/docs/known-issues",
